#472 research only, never in MESA_PATCHES: LIMA_X switches and per-cause reload counters for lima, on top of
Mesa 26.2.6 + linux/userspace/mesa/0001-0007 (docs/research/gpu-demo-gap/midpass.md). Bits: 1 no rename (0006 off),
2 wait for each job, 4 reload PLBU state, 8 no depth reload, 16 depth reload first, 32 early-z off for reload jobs,
64 wait before each reload job, 128 reload clip off, 256 log counters, 512 no reload, 1024 no depth write-back,
2048 reload sample centre offset, 4096 flush the readers then rename.

